      "block_id": "2605.28615_p9_b8",
      "text": "Evaluation Benchmarks. We evaluate the effectiveness of our method on four challenging benchmarks de-\nsigned to assess compositional capabilities in text-to-image generation, i.e. T2I-CompBench [18], GenEval [12],\nDPG-Bench [17] and GenEval 2 [20].\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.87,
        350.15,
        542.8,
        386.92
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
